Items/v1/","context":{"app_id":2669710,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2669710","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:32:53Z","value":16,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4586560","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846651706694987","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest: One of Polygon's 10 Best Demos!","summary":"Allie has talked through the demo, and you are cordially invited to watch. In fact, it's hard not to miss, as it's all over our page.It's like a director's commentary on a DVD, if you are ancient enough to remember those. It's weird, irreverent, and delivered in our own \"house style.\" Hang about and let it play, or, if you prefer to watch, call upon us on YouTube.A word on Steam Next Fest.Visibility is in October 2026, let us say, a “challenge”. Can a game be more niche than a tearoom simulator ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:11:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694987","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:22:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846651706691216","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Goreytown, Nextfesters!","summary":"What's in the demo?Blend & Bake. Combine ingredients to discover recipes that soothe a customer, damn them, or kill them.Support or thwart. Help the town's residents poison a rival, scare off a governess, or prepare for the Halloween Ball. The choice is yours; so are the consequences.Be cordial, be immoral. Leave your idea of \"moral\" at the door. Make friends, make enemies, and keep an eye on that nosey Officer Oscar. The first two days of the full game. Open the tearoom, take your first orders,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:49:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846018067945095","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"Ten Thousand Wishlists?! 💀","summary":"Ten thousand wishlists, if you please,Have left us all quite weak at the knees.We thank you all, from kitchen to stair.The patrons, pictured, do not care.One patron lifts a tea in toast,Even the one who is a ghost.Do mind the cup they pour for you.We thank you most sincerely, too.\\꧁ ༺ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ ·𖥸· ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ༻ ꧂꧁ Follow Sundew Studios on Socials ꧂༻ Instagram༻ TikTok༻ YouTube༻ Or sign up to our Newsletter!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T19:08:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846018067942442","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Cooking Fest 2026","summary":"It might surprise some to see Tearoom of Terror in Steam's Cooking Fest 2026, but here we all are. If you're looking for cooking but a bit different - maybe more creepy, maybe more deadly, maybe more ghastly - the do give our demo a spin!꧁ ༺ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ ·𖥸· ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ༻ ꧂꧁ Follow Sundew Studios on Socials ꧂༻ Instagram༻ TikTok༻ YouTube༻ Or sign up to our Newsletter!꧁ ༺ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ · · ─ ·𖥸· ─ · ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:05:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846018067942262","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet Tearoom of Terror's Dev Team!","summary":"COZY AFTER DARK SHOWCASE WAS AWESOME!We're incredibly humbled to feature amongst so many games that will one day (possibly immediately) be added to our Steam Library of Future Joys.If you missed the Showcase, here's the dev spotlight we made. Like us, it's a bit cursed, weirdly cute and slightly unhinged. But it's got a lot of heart and gave Allie an excuse to decorate for Halloween early. Here's the transcript of the video for anyone using a screen reader, or who just prefers text over the movi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T20:59:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942262","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846018067934128","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"We're in Cozy After Dark Showcase!","summary":"HEAR YE, HEAR YE, DENIZENS OF GOREYTOWN!Tearoom of Terror has been summoned to the COZY AFTER DARK SHOWCASE - a grand new gathering celebrating the cute, the creepy, and the thoroughly cursed.We'll be unveiling a brand-new video, presented in our own inimitable style (the kettle is already screaming). We are also positively thrilled to meet our fellow Others in Arms, those marvelous studios lurking on the fringes of what it means to be cozy.Join us from 12th to 19th October. Watch on Cozy After ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T17:15:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1846018067925935","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"THANK YOU LUMPYSPACEPRINCESS!!!","summary":"OH MY GLOBNESSWe have our first demo review!!! And we're pretty sure it's from THE LumpySpacePrincess. You know - of Adventure Time fame. We're so grateful to anyone who plays or reviews our games, but having the mauve queen themselves come out of retirement on Ooo to try Tearoom of Terror is truly an honor we couldn't have imagined! Thank you for being our first and most definitely our favorite ever review.THE THING ABOUT REVIEWSI'm not here to teach my grandmother to suck eggs - she was alread","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T12:23:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925935","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1845383656383173","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO OUT NOW!","summary":"Your aunt has died. She left you tea,A calendar, and a mystery.Thirteen regulars come to call,And each peculiar, one and all.Every one unfailingly civil,What a pity they are all evil!Two days are yours to bake and brew,And grant a favour, or a fewOf questionable sort. Do heedThe dog. He's very good, indeed.There are seven ways to perish here.The law's not the only thing to fear.Solve the murder by Hallowe'en.Or join your aunt. It's quite routine.Play the demo on PC. Do wishlist. It's only polite","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T17:27:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1836506165568836","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"update","title":"Late Summerween: Development Update","summary":"Welcome, dearest reader,The tea has grown cold in the several months since I dispatched my last missive. I recognize my silence has grown quite worrisome, as it should. After all, Goreytown is a place known for its unpleasantries and trickeries and the dismal fates many of our citizens befall.To those who have tapped the proverbial window and inquired after our questionable continued existence, let me put your minds at ease. We do unquestionably continue to exist. The fine folks at Sundew Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T19:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568836","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2669710-1817483467046140","game_id":"steam-2669710","kind":"update","title":"Midwinter Spirits: Development Update","summary":"Welcome, proprietors...We're delighted to be part of this year's Midwinter Festival. What better way to celebrate than to sit by the fire and learn what we've been working on this past month since we announced Tearoom of Terror?First, here's where you'll be staying. This was once your aunt's bedroom, but now that she's dead, it's yours. When the fire is lit, it can be quite cozy...You also have a sundew that will help keep the kitchen free of pests. Perhaps, if it eats enough, it will bloom...Ot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-01T18:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467046140","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2669710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2669710":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2669710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z"},"4586560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:55:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2669710","app_id":2669710,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3e2fdea4ca053290708f2774a9bb5ab319cb0fecbb664da1522c901b252a62f6","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Congratulations on your inheritance: one tearoom, one murdered aunt, 22 regulars who know where the *ahem* bodies are buried. Brew tea, bake treats and try to solve the mystery of your aunt's murder before Halloween - or end up on the menu yourself.","publishers":[{"name":"Sundew Studios","creator_clan_account_id":35443940}],"developers":[{"name":"Sundew Studios","creator_clan_account_id":35443940}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1806476400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Announcement Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1784730263","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2669710/191669665/88056906216f226e0d6058be087f86bd2558c4b4/1784730016/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"2669710/191669665/88056906216f226e0d6058be087f